[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9422.15, "timestamp": "02:37:02", "text": "以及其他一些东西。我的生活一直如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9429.349, "timestamp": "02:37:09", "text": "那很好。约翰，你呢？我？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9432.79, "timestamp": "02:37:12", "text": "呃，我不知道。我心情复杂。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9435.27, "timestamp": "02:37:15", "text": "一切都按计划进行"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9439.429, "timestamp": "02:37:19", "text": "现在很开心"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9442.07, "timestamp": "02:37:22", "text": "由于以下原因，入学申请被取消了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9446.63, "timestamp": "02:37:26", "text": "印巴战争那件事。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9448.95, "timestamp": "02:37:28", "text": "战争仍在继续。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9450.389, "timestamp": "02:37:30", "text": "他们还在为一些事情争吵。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9454.07, "timestamp": "02:37:34", "text": "等等，事情还没结束。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9456.63, "timestamp": "02:37:36", "text": "他们确实一度停止了，但是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9458.87, "timestamp": "02:37:38", "text": "别指望他们会就此罢休。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9460.63, "timestamp": "02:37:40", "text": "兄弟，咱们还是别谈这个了。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9465.19, "timestamp": "02:37:45", "text": "是的。是的。是的。呃，我当时就是那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9469.27, "timestamp": "02:37:49", "text": "就像某个同学一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9471.75, "timestamp": "02:37:51", "text": "呃，我觉得学院里的人他们挺友好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9474.309, "timestamp": "02:37:54", "text": "我不知道是谁，但他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9476.389, "timestamp": "02:37:56", "text": "算是跟其中一个人说了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9478.71, "timestamp": "02:37:58", "text": "同学们都这么跟我说，他还给我打了电话。"}]